    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare phylogenetic affinity of species occupying different habitats within a continent or sea against ecologically matched species on other continents or seas. Support requires geography to predict relatedness and replacement better than habitat similarity.";
